      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `ebfb02e4452684cbaadc9de70acca57e486e52ca7984e5f842711fc54a058a3c--5.-Victims-of-family-and-domestic-violence-related-offences.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2019\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 7778eaf0b5622fb57bf479892cbced954a5c7d3641354367b9bdc47a928a8f6c | missing |\n| \"Table 22\" | 1d3b2fe8c4a5ae6e1daafad24e1b1002a37ea4f2acfbc774122bb232494eaccd | missing |\n| \"Table 23\" | 667fb9ccf506cdf3c42dbb55f6e94ee0c4bfcd59ecaf6d49324226563f6a81b9 | missing |\n| \"Table 24\" | 7cf9519d8e4e8d81805728a23aec23da59a30bb3484d71d0c082a18eef7c15da | missing |\n| \"Table 25\" | 82c280960ffa95eb8b11771ca3ba19287d6fe66fe569ba226c672477298ea75a | missing |\n| \"Table 26\" | d60a84fa66b6ce80923a441e5b0724d28d5c24127e3fef51ab9db52551f116dd | missing |\n| \"Table 27\" | cdda38e8f8e5a1b8d3df9540e50e0284e828987aa52622c83d27cc67aec00de4 | missing |\n| \"Table 28\" | 1139b616a65cbc1d3887a1cadad7823ed0839d61a846f9cd7cb4bf930238dde9 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
